# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# A number of files were originally committed with CRLF. Prettier's default
# (`endOfLine: "lf"`) rewrites them to LF, which made every `npm run format`
# produce a whole-file diff. Pinning LF here keeps formatting runs stable.
# Files already committed with CRLF are converted as they are next touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never line-ending-converted or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
